    addNote("v1.1.5: retry registration on IPID rejection (FF FF 02)")
    addNote("v1.1.5: 注册被拒（FF FF 02）自动重试")
    addNote("        auto-reconnect when IP/IPID changed at runtime")
    addNote("        运行时修改 IP/IPID 自动重连")
    addNote("v1.1.6: monitor log split into System / RX / TX")
    addNote("v1.1.6: 监控日志分为系统 / RX / TX 三区")
    addNote("        System=events, RX=Crestron->QSC, TX=QSC->Crestron")
    addNote("        系统=事件, RX=收到, TX=发送")
    addNote("v1.1.7: full output sync after (re)registration")
